--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party and runtime requirements

1. OriginLab Origin / OriginPro (commercial software, licensed separately)
   This plugin drives a locally installed copy of Origin through COM
   automation. It does NOT bundle, redistribute, or sublicense Origin.
   You must own a valid Origin licence to use these tools.

2. originpro / OriginExt Python packages — BSD licence, Copyright OriginLab
   https://www.originlab.com
   Installed by the user (`pip install originpro`), not redistributed here.

3. The figure-formatting scripts vendored in this repository
   (format_thesis_figures.py, format_composite.py, export_figures.py)
   originate from the author's own PhD-thesis plotting toolchain and are
   released here under the same MIT terms by their copyright holder.

4. NumPy (BSD) and Pillow (MIT-CMU) are optional runtime dependencies used by
   the vendored scripts for render-measurement steps; without them the
   corresponding self-checks are skipped.
